{"synopsis":"Pernahkah kau melihat raksasa setinggi seratus meter berjalan santai di tengah kota manusia modern? Pernahkah kau membayangkan seekor burung ilahi yang membawa malapetaka dunia, tinggal di atas cakrawala, terus-menerus memandang ke bumi? Pernahkah kau mendengar tentang peradaban yang menyebut dirinya Dewa, datang dari sisi jauh bintang-bintang? Pernahkah kau mengunjungi web Soulscans selaku yang mengerjakan? Sejak tahun pertama SMA, Chen Du mengalami mimpi yang sama setiap hari. Dalam mimpi itu, ada sebuah kristal biru. Setelah 30 detik, gelombang monster muncul. Monster-monster ini memiliki satu tujuan yang sama: menghancurkan kristal tersebut. Selama 2 tahun dia jatuh koma, kemudian setelah itu kembali ke sekolah untuk mendominasi dan menorehkan pencapaian.","alternative_title":"高武：天才只是见我的门槛！","author":"新星漫画Star_Comics","artist":"新星漫画Star_Comics","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"cfee4ed5-5583-4aa6-bb3f-a5729c6e8227","number":"25","chapter":"25","title":"","date":"2026-07-17","released":"2026-07-17"},{"chapter_id":"6f9c78d4-2b3d-4146-abf2-597ccb2ddb33","number":"24","chapter":"24","title":"","date":"2026-07-16","released":"2026-07-16"},{"chapter_id":"6ee4c65b-8951-4c0f-a87f-e2c2915f8276","number":"23","chapter":"23","title":"","date":"2026-07-15","released":"2026-07-15"},{"chapter_id":"6af2829f-8920-4858-8879-d4af50dcb164","number":"22","chapter":"22","title":"","date":"2026-07-14","released":"2026-07-14"},{"chapter_id":"6eb68a4d-632f-4ada-b8aa-51144ffb50dd","number":"21","chapter":"21","title":"","date":"2026-07-13","released":"2026-07-13"},{"chapter_id":"d939aa68-c984-4e67-9b0f-d15e906034ca","number":"20","chapter":"20","title":"","date":"2026-07-12","released":"2026-07-12"},{"chapter_id":"e648f038-14e5-4e76-9f40-bc00b5127fb7","number":"19","chapter":"19","title":"","date":"2026-07-11","released":"2026-07-11"},{"chapter_id":"2974ef4f-d0b2-4575-895c-d53d53d93295","number":"18","chapter":"18","title":"","date":"2026-07-11","released":"2026-07-11"},{"chapter_